  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF hiv prev youth SEE</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNICEF hiv ungd SEE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till UNICEF f&#xf6;r ett HIV-f&#xf6;rebyggande projekt som v&#xe4;nder sig till speciellt utsatta ungdomar i Syd&#xf6;stra Europa; i  Bosnien-Herzegovina,Kosovo,Makedonien, Montenegro,och Serbien. M&#xe5;l f&#xf6;r projektet &#xe4;r bl.a. att bidra till att regeringarna f&#xe5;r &#xf6;kad kapacitet att utforma v&#xe4;lintegrerade och helt&#xe4;ckande HIV/AIDS f&#xf6;rebyggande insatser f&#xf6;r ungdomar, att ungdomsmottagningar blit</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UNICEF to a HIV-prevention project with special focus on especially vulnerable young people in Southeastern Europe; in Bosnia&amp;Herzegovina,Kosovo, Macedonia, Montenegro and Serbia. The goal is to increase the knowledge and skills among vulnerable young people so that they are able to protect themselves against HIV/AIDS. Some objectives are that MoH should establish youth-friendly services.</narrative>
  </description>
